--- !u!114 &776497445
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 776497443}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 235f8ecdf2811d943a8e23d4d2a603f4, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    name: Birb
    sentences:
    - 'Welcome to Sorting Hatchery and Nursery!



'
    - "Thank you for working with us on important Dragon and Dinosaur conservation
      work. \nBecause of increased poaching of these magnificent creatures, their
      populations are declining, even in their natural habitats. This hatchery is
      a way for us to try and stabilize the populations and give back to creatures
      so vital to our world."
    - "Welcome to the work floor! \nThis is where you\u2019ll be spending most of
      your time here. Your job is to sort between dragon and dinosaur eggs so we
      can send them to the correct incubators. \nEgg identification can be a bit
      tricky, so try to keep an eye out for defining features to differentiate eggs.
      You\u2019ll keep learning about what traits might indicate an egg\u2019s species
      as you go!\r"
    - Start with sorting five eggs into two baskets.
    - Great! Now click and drag the one basket of eggs into the dragon or the dinosaur
      incubator.
    - 'Good work! Deliver the second basket of eggs to the other incubator.

'
    - "Let\u2019s see how you did!"
